#concept-box("Carry this into Chapter 2")[
  Chapter 1 gives you the instrument; Chapter 2 gives you the thing it measures. The next chapter is the plot in order — three movements, six beats and twelve chapters — because a sequence question is the one shape that cannot be answered from a single card. You need the cards and the chain.
]

